      "whatsnew": "<p>IntelliJ IDEA 2025.3 is now out! The highlights of this release include:</p>\n<p>Productivity-enhancing features:</p>\n<ul>\n <li>Unified distribution</li>\n <li>Command completion</li>\n <li>Spring Debugger improvements</li>\n <li><em>Islands</em> theme</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Support for new technologies:</p>\n<ul>\n <li>Spring Boot 4 and Spring Framework 7</li>\n <li>Java 25</li>\n <li>Spring Data JDBC</li>\n <li>Vitest 4</li>\n</ul>\n<p>AI upgrades:</p>\n<ul>\n <li>Bring Your Own Key (Coming soon)</li>\n <li>Native support for Junie and Claude Agent</li>\n <li>Transparent AI quota</li>\n</ul>\n<p>\n <br>\n Visit our <a href=\"https://www.jetbrains.com/idea/whatsnew/\">What's New page</a> to learn about these and other improvements.\n</p>",
